#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid "EOV VAE"
msgstr "EOV VAE"

#: plugin.toml
msgctxt "plugin.toml"
msgid ""
"Reconstruction-error analysis with ONNX VAE models, showing how unlike the "
"training data the tissue looks: heat maps, reconstructions, error statistics "
"and highest-error regions. Research use only; not for diagnosis."
msgstr ""
"Analiza napake rekonstrukcije z modeli ONNX VAE, ki pokaže, koliko se tkivo "
"razlikuje od učnih podatkov: toplotni zemljevidi, rekonstrukcije, statistika "
"napak in območja z največjo napako. Samo za raziskovalno uporabo; ni "
"namenjeno diagnostiki."

#: src/batch.rs:89
msgid ""
"VAE reconstruction error of every tissue tile: tiles.csv, heatmap.png and "
"summary.json per slide"
msgstr ""
"Napaka rekonstrukcije VAE za vsako ploščico tkiva: tiles.csv, heatmap.png in "
"summary.json za vsak preparat"

#: src/batch.rs:94
msgid "the ONNX model (default: the one chosen in eov's VAE sidebar)"
msgstr ""
"model ONNX (privzeto: tisti, ki je izbran v stranski vrstici VAE programa "
"eov)"

#. Translators: a batch parameter: keep auto, cpu and cuda, the values typed
#: src/batch.rs:104
msgid "auto (CUDA, else the CPU), cpu or cuda"
msgstr "auto (CUDA, sicer CPU), cpu ali cuda"

#: src/batch.rs:109
msgid "tiles per inference batch, for models without a fixed batch"
msgstr ""
"število ploščic na serijo sklepanja za modele brez fiksne velikosti serije"

#: src/batch.rs:114
msgid "CPU inference threads (0: every core)"
msgstr "niti CPU za sklepanje (0: vsa jedra)"

#: src/batch.rs:119
msgid "allow TF32 on CUDA (faster, slightly different results)"
msgstr "dovoli TF32 na CUDA (hitreje, nekoliko drugačni rezultati)"

#. Translators: a batch parameter: keep auto, the value typed
#: src/batch.rs:126
msgid ""
"auto (tiles resampled to the model's µm/px) or a downsample, e.g. 4 (that "
"level's own pixels)"
msgstr ""
"auto (ploščice, prevzorčene na µm/px modela) ali faktor pomanjšanja, npr. 4 "
"(lastne slikovne pike te ravni)"

#: src/batch.rs:132
msgid "skip glass tiles"
