#: src/batch.rs:140
msgid ""
"error-map colours: auto (p05–p95 of each slide) or lo,hi (mean absolute "
"error; the same scale for every slide)"
msgstr ""
"barve zemljevida napak: auto (p05–p95 posameznega preparata) ali lo,hi "
"(povprečna absolutna napaka; enaka lestvica za vse preparate)"

#. Translators: a batch parameter: keep off, store and reuse, the values typed
#: src/batch.rs:148
msgid ""
"off; store (keep the results for eov's viewer); or reuse (also take tiles "
"analysed before with the same model and settings)"
msgstr ""
"off; store (ohrani rezultate za pregledovalnik eov) ali reuse (uporabi tudi "
"ploščice, ki so bile prej analizirane z istim modelom in nastavitvami)"

