#. Translators: Original and Reconstruction are overlays (the Overlay menu)
#: src/sidebar.rs:35
msgid ""
"This eov does not report its display adjustments: reconstructions are shown "
"without them, so reset gamma, contrast and stain normalisation before "
"comparing Original and Reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"Ta različica programa eov ne sporoča svojih prilagoditev prikaza: "
"rekonstrukcije so prikazane brez njih, zato pred primerjavo prekrivnih "
"plasti Izvirnik in Rekonstrukcija ponastavite gamo, kontrast in "
"normalizacijo barvanja."

#. Translators: Original and Reconstruction are overlays (the Overlay menu); {} names the stain processing
#: src/sidebar.rs:43
msgid ""
"Reconstructions get this pane's gamma, brightness, contrast and sharpening, "
"but not its stain processing ({}): turn that off before comparing Original "
"and Reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"Rekonstrukcije prevzamejo gamo, svetlost, kontrast in ostrenje tega podokna, "
"ne pa tudi njegove obdelave barvanja ({}): pred primerjavo prekrivnih plasti "
"Izvirnik in Rekonstrukcija jo izklopite."

#: src/sidebar.rs:50
msgid ""
"Reconstructions are shown with this pane's display adjustments, like the "
"slide."
msgstr ""
"Rekonstrukcije so prikazane s prilagoditvami prikaza tega podokna, tako kot "
"preparat."

#: src/sidebar.rs:58
msgid ""
"Errors are measured on the slide's own pixels; display adjustments do not "
"change them."
msgstr ""
"Napake se merijo na izvirnih slikovnih pikah preparata; prilagoditve prikaza "
"nanje ne vplivajo."

